### ==============================================================================
### SDP ROOM BOOKING - RESTful API Production Test Collection (Undiksha)
### Stack: Laravel 12 · MariaDB 11 (Docker) · Sanctum Token · File Storage
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTENTIKASI (Sanctum Token)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Login Admin (Seeder: admin@undiksha.ac.id / password)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@undiksha.ac.id",
  "password": "password"
}

### Simpan token admin ke variabel
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 1.2 Login Mahasiswa (Seeder: mhs1@undiksha.ac.id / password)
# @name loginMhs
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "mhs1@undiksha.ac.id",
  "password": "password"
}

### Simpan token mahasiswa ke variabel
@mhsToken = {{loginMhs.response.body.data.token}}

### 1.3 Register Akun Baru (Mahasiswa / Dosen)
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Mahasiswa Baru Undiksha",
  "email": "mhsbaru@undiksha.ac.id",
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123",
  "role": "mahasiswa",
  "nim_nip": "2215101099",
  "phone": "081999888777",
  "unit": "Ilmu Komputer"
}

### 1.4 Get Profile User Login
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.5 Logout User
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. MASTER DATA - GEDUNG & FASILITAS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 List Semua Gedung (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/buildings
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Tambah Gedung Baru (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "GTI",
  "name": "Gedung Teknologi Informasi"
}

### 2.3 List Semua Fasilitas (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/facilities
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Tambah Fasilitas Baru (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/facilities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Interactive Podiums"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. MASTER DATA - RUANGAN & STORAGE (UPLOAD FOTO)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 List Ruangan (Dengan Search, Filter & Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms?page=1&per_page=5&type=kelas&status=active
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Detail Ruangan Beserta Fasilitas & URL Foto
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/1
Accept: application/json

### 3.3 Cek Ketersediaan Slot Ruangan pada Tanggal Tertentu
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/1/availability?date=2026-10-21
Accept: application/json

### 3.4 Tambah Ruangan Baru + Upload Foto ke Storage (Admin Only - Multipart)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Accept: application/json

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="building_id"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="code"

GKB-301
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Ruang Kuliah Teori Multimedia 301
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="floor"

3
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="capacity"

50
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="type"

kelas
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

active
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="facility_ids[]"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="facility_ids[]"

2
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. BOOKING FLOW & UJI CONCURRENCY (ANTI DOUBLE-BOOKING)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Ajukan Pemesanan Ruangan (Sukses - 201 Created)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "title": "Bimbingan Skripsi Gelombang 1",
  "purpose": "Konsultasi BAB 4 dan 5 tugas akhir bersama dosen pembimbing",
  "attendees": 10,
  "start_at": "2026-10-25 09:00:00",
  "end_at": "2026-10-25 12:00:00"
}

@newBookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.data.id}}

### 4.2 UJI DOUBLE-BOOKING: Pemesanan Bentrok pada Jam yang Sama (Ekspektasi: 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "title": "Kegiatan Rapat Organisasi Mahasiswa (Bentrok)",
  "purpose": "Jadwal ini bertabrakan dengan bimbingan skripsi di atas",
  "attendees": 15,
  "start_at": "2026-10-25 10:00:00",
  "end_at": "2026-10-25 13:00:00"
}

### 4.3 List Pemesanan (Admin melihat semua, Mahasiswa hanya miliknya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 Setujui Pemesanan Ruangan (Admin Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{newBookingId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.5 Check-in Pemakaian Ruangan (Saat Waktu Penggunaan Dimulai)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{newBookingId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "actual_attendees": 12
}

### 4.6 Check-out Pemakaian Ruangan & Selesai (Completed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{newBookingId}}/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "actual_attendees": 12
}

### 4.7 Tolak Pemesanan Ruangan (Admin Only - Wajib Alasan)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/2/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "rejection_reason": "Ruangan akan disterilisasi untuk persiapan akreditasi program studi."
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. MONITORING & DASHBOARD METRICS (Admin Only)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Ringkasan Dashboard (Total Ruangan, Ongoing, Booking Hari Ini)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.2 Statistik Utilisasi Ruangan (Ruangan Terpopuler & Pemakaian Gedung)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/utilization
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. PENGUJIAN RBAC & PENANGANAN ERROR STANDAR PRODUKSI
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Uji 403 Forbidden: Mahasiswa Mencoba Menyetujui Booking
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{newBookingId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 Uji 401 Unauthorized: Akses Endpoint Terproteksi Tanpa Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

### 6.3 Uji 422 Unprocessable Entity: Validasi Peserta Melebihi Kapasitas Ruangan
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{mhsToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "title": "Konser Musik di Ruang Kelas",
  "attendees": 500,
  "start_at": "2026-10-26 10:00:00",
  "end_at": "2026-10-26 12:00:00"
}
